        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 88DTPH, 88 Series Solid Brass Double Roll Toilet Tissue Holder</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in either satin nickel or polished chrome finishes, the 88 Series Toilet Paper Holder is made with the attention to quality for which Deltana is known. The sleek, modern look will look great in any contemporary decor. A double toilet paper holder, the 88DTPH holds two rolls at once.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-88DTPH-specifications.gif?v=1704354746\" width=\"575\" height=\"322\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 88DTPH Toilet Paper Holder Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana 88 Series\"><b>Deltana 88 Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the 88 Solid Brass Double Toilet Paper Holder:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 11-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Arm Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Diameter: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-88DTPH-specifications.pdf?v=1691095350\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 88DTPH Toilet Paper Holder Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 toilet tissue holder, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
